 - The `catch` gates `onError` on `error instanceof Error` ([chatOrchestrator.ts#L150](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts#L150)), so a rejection that is not an `Error` — a thrown string or object — bypasses `onError` entirely while still propagating to the caller.
-- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits ([chatOrchestrator.ts#L148](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.ts#L148)), and is passed the `lastUsage` local — the most recent round's usage, not a sum across tool rounds, so a deployer using the hook for billing or audit under-counts every turn that ran tools.
+
+## Usage reported to afterModelResponse
+
+- `afterModelResponse` is called once per user message after the round loop exits, and is handed the turn's usage: the sum across every provider call the turn made, so a turn that ran two tool rounds reports both calls' token counts rather than the last call's alone ([validated by: reports the usage of every provider call in a turn that ran two tool rounds, not the last round alone](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.usage.acceptance.test.ts#L56)).
+- What the hook receives carries the per-round breakdown beside that total, so the signature itself says the flat token counts are a sum and a deployer wanting provider-call granularity keeps it ([validated by: reports the usage of every provider call in a turn that ran two tool rounds, not the last round alone](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.usage.acceptance.test.ts#L56)).
+- A provider that reports no usage on some rounds does not turn the total into `undefined` or `NaN`: the rounds that did report are still summed, and a turn where no round reported still reports no usage ([validated by: counts the rounds that reported usage when a round reports none, and still reports nothing when no round did](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.usage.acceptance.test.ts#L85)).
+- A turn that ran no tools reports exactly what it reported before the turn total existed: the single provider call's usage ([validated by: receives collected response text and usage](../../src/orchestration/chatOrchestrator.test.ts#L236)).
